{"id":"steam-1068590","steam":1068590,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Project Sundive","summary":"Project Sundive is wave-based arena auto-shooter roguelite, focusing on ship customization and ridiculously overpowered builds","about":"Can You Assemble Your Ultimate Spaceship?\n\nProject Sundive is a 2D wave-based arena auto-shooter roguelite, where you pilot a spaceship, while your weapons attack nearby enemies. Between rounds, you spend your collected gold on new weapons and boosts, allowing you to create unique and overpowered builds.\n\n\r\nDying or winning will end the run. You start again, with  another shot at creating a build strong enough to defeat the final boss.\nDrift in Space\n\nPiloting the ship requires you to master physics. \n\nYour ship only rotates towards the mouse, while keeping its full inertia. Thrusting will accelerate you in the direction you are facing, so it's up to you to find the perfect curve to avoid the enemies.\n\nAssemble Your Ship\n\nEach round you collect gold to buy weapons and boosts, or upgrade your  existing ones by combining the correct stats. \n\nEach block is slotted into a hex grid, where boosts and corruptions are affecting their adjacent weapons.\n\nLet Bosses Corrupt You\n\nEvery 4 waves you fight a boss and receive a special corruption block, which greatly alters your build and playstyle.\n\nGet Even Crazier Next Run\n\nEach run gives you the opportunity to discover and unlock new weapons and ships, allowing you to build even crazier spaceships in your next run.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068590/f9f9a60f5e8552c561bc72fe6b8e4f566783c294/library_capsule.jpg?t=1790195696","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068590/c24ed68c4b152e21e08f0a3e62e2f6feef77952f/header.jpg?t=1790195696","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068590/898d1e86c982f734845b6197ba5c1131b9de56c2/library_hero.jpg?t=